<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55318" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατά-στρωμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is spread upon</i> or <i>over</i>: in a ship,
				<i>deck</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.118
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				119
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				1.4.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>La.</u>
				184a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				22.5
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταστρώματα διὰ πάσης [τῆς
				νεώς</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.14
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἀπὸ τῶν κ.</span>, i.e. the
			fighting men, opp. the rowers, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.40
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> part of the
			constellation Argo, <i><span class="en">
				Hipparch.
				1.8.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Alm.</u>
				8.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλίνθινα κ.</span> a tile <i>roof,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AB
				269
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>LW</u>
				3.141
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Ephesus</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>floor, pavement</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Mech.
				13.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				6.2.10
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
